	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quandoquidem fore spero idque brevi, ut istic tecum sim, mi venerande <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>charissimeque <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, non est, ut prolixis literis te fatigem, quum prę<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sertim de novis rebus nihil prorsus noverim, quod hic <persName ref="p7132">Samuel Wit<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tenbachus</persName>, charissimus compater meus ignoret, qui tibi <placeName>Galli</placeName> conatus, quos <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ex sororio suo, d. <persName ref="p8519">Mirabili</persName>, resciscit, non illubenter exposuerit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Commendarem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tibi virum multis, nisi vel hinc, quam sit tibi commendatissimus, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nemini esset obscurum, quod tuo beneficio tam egregie dotata sibi contigit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>uxor id, quod de corporis atque etiam animi dotibus intelligas velim; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quod enim fortunę dotes attinet, habet forte, quod non immerito queratur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Sed poterit tamen hac etiam parte tua opera tuaque authoritate, quod damni <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hactenus facit, facile sarciri.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod ut fiat, ipse quoque te, quam possum amanter <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et obnixe rogo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sunt enim, qui putent hinc illum frigidius amare <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>uxorem, quod, quę dotis nomine a socru et affinibus promissa sunt, non <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>receperit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Qui si fidem hic suam liberarent, melius quoque ac omnino commo<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>dius haberet castissima matrona.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Er wil nit vil uf ir haben.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Ist gar ung<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ern daheim und unfruntlichs dings im hus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Si hat mir in vertruwen alerlei klagt <foreign xml:lang="la">de avibus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>coram<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">In kursiver Schrift die in Geheimschrift verfassten Worte.</note>.</foreign></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Salveat tua domus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis mea vice, quam potes reverenter, optimos viros <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>symmystas tuos cum cęteris amicis et fratribus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvere te iubent seque <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>christianis votis tuis commendant d. quęstor <persName ref="p1057">Fuchsius</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p1057">Peter Fuchs</persName>.</note>, d. <persName>Iacobus</persName> senior, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>deinde etiam iunior, <persName ref="p4868">Funclius</persName> meus, cum reliquis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Iuva nos sacris precati<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>onibus tuis diligenter.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l49">Bielis</placeName> 28. anno 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">T<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>[uus] <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p8055">Am<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>br[osius] Bl[aurerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Pr<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>aeclarissimo doctrina pieta<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>teque viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, amico incomparabili <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fratrique in Christo longe charissimo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tigu[ri]</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
